Print the exact width and height of a label, with markup applied

Usage: kashika measure [OPTIONS] <TEXT>...

Arguments:
  <TEXT>...  Texts to measure, with markup and `\n` escapes as in a .kash string; one result per text

Options:
      --size <SIZE>      Font size in px [default: 14]
      --weight <WEIGHT>  [default: normal] [possible values: normal, bold]
      --format <FORMAT>  [default: text] [possible values: text, json]
  -h, --help             Print help
